<title>ARGENTINA: SOCCER-ARGENTINA AND CHILE DRAW 1-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ARGENTINA AND CHILE DRAW 1-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-12-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina and Chile drew</p>
<p>1-1 (halftime 0-0) in a South American World Cup qualifying</p>
<p>match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Argentina - Gabriel Batistuta (70th minute, penalty)</p>
<p>Chile - Fernando Cornejo (49th)</p>
<p>Attendance: 60,000</p>
</text>
